<title>POLAND: Grajewo, Forte in long-term deal.</title>
<headline>Grajewo, Forte in long-term deal.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish chip board maker Grajewo SA signed a long-term deal to deliver production materials to furniture producer Forte SA until the middle of 2002, Forte said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the estimated value of the contract will be about 17 million zlotys this year and about 65 million in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
